      "hasFactoryDefault": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Author of the citation. Rendered after the body as `— Author`.\nWhen `source` is also set, the two are joined with a comma.\nCan be overridden via the `#author` slot for custom rendering\n(e.g. wrap in a link to a bio page).",
